gaze with your eyes. \n\nJump right into magical, rollercoaster journey through a prehistoric world! Come along for the ride with Jonas and Amy as the river propels you, dinosaurs chase you, and Rukus delights you!\n\nRaising a Rukus is the first episode of the groundbreaking new franchise from the Academy Award Winning Production Designer of Avatar and the Director of Maleficent.", "short_description": "This adventure requires 2.6 GB total.\n\nRide along with twins Amy and Jonas as they chase their mischievous pet dog, Rukus, through an amazing adventure into a prehistoric world. \n\nWith cutting edge \u201cbranching narratives,\u201d choose which character to follow and discover a different path with a simple gaze of your eyes!\n\nA new animated experience from Oscar-winner Robert Stromberg and The Virtual Reality Company."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.thevrcompany.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.thevrcompany.com/terms-of-use", "publisher_name": "The Virtual Reality Company", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.thevrcompany.com/raising-a-rukus", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ACTION", "ADVENTURE", "EDUCATIONAL", "MOVIE", "NARRATIVE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_US"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER", "TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1527313400983886"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162680_438420913172078_3370516121437339648_n.png?stp=d